{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5068ee9ff760bd4d080bc126e01cf8c6.poster.avif?t=1760519956\" width=1170 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5068ee9ff760bd4d080bc126e01cf8c6.webm?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5068ee9ff760bd4d080bc126e01cf8c6.mp4?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every Stop Matters.</strong><br><strong>Play the single-player demo for Bus Bound today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/042509dc4821725d7ae7807ce7625e83.poster.avif?t=1760519956\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/042509dc4821725d7ae7807ce7625e83.webm?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/042509dc4821725d7ae7807ce7625e83.mp4?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Drive through Ashtree, the first district you will service in the full release of Bus Bound! Master the ebbs and flows of the city\u2019s traffic through morning, afternoon and nighttime shifts. Experience rain or sunshine\u2013each will present different challenges in your goal to deliver your passengers safely to their destinations.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5f83b1babbcebac45cb08625a2823381.poster.avif?t=1760519956\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5f83b1babbcebac45cb08625a2823381.webm?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5f83b1babbcebac45cb08625a2823381.mp4?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Master two distinct buses from community favorite manufacturers: the Bluebird Sigma and New Flyer Industries\u2019 Excelsior Clean Diesel. This sample of the 17 buses available in the full release will give you a taste of what it takes to maneuver these powerful vehicles through an evolving city filled with life.<br> <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/7f2da7002abd26905f9981f8adb3e0bd.poster.avif?t=1760519956\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/7f2da7002abd26905f9981f8adb3e0bd.webm?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/7f2da7002abd26905f9981f8adb3e0bd.mp4?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The safe delivery and satisfaction of your passengers will yield multiple rewards, ranging from unlocking new districts, special bonuses to progression depending on the bus you choose and additional color palette options/livery for the ultimate self-expression. Customize your routes to be as focused or broad as you desire and\u2013over time\u2013build from a limitation of five stops per route to as many as you can handle in one run!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010830?t=1760519956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010830?t=1760519956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/4566cce58cd2376ef62795509a9c3e26d32ba455/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760519956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/4566cce58cd2376ef62795509a9c3e26d32ba455/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760519956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5068ee9ff760bd4d080bc126e01cf8c6.poster.avif?t=1760519956\" width=1170 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5068ee9ff760bd4d080bc126e01cf8c6.webm?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/5068ee9ff760bd4d080bc126e01cf8c6.mp4?t=1760519956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every Stop Matters.</strong><br><strong>Play the single-player demo for Bus Bound today!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/042509dc4821725d7ae7807ce7625e83.poster.avif?t=1760519956\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010830/extras/042509dc4821725d7ae7807ce7625e83.webm?t=1760519956\" type=\"vide